# E-commerce Shopping Cart

- Product
    - Attributes : ProductId, Name, Price, Description, StockQuantity
    - Methods : getDetails(), updateStock(), applyDiscount()

- Cart Item :
    - Attributes : Product (Product Object), quantity
    - Methods : decreaseQuantity(), TotalQuantity()

- Shopping Cart :
    - Attributes : Items, cartId
    - Methods : addItem(products, quantity), removeItem(productId), calculateTotalItems(), clearCart()

- Customer :
    - Attributes : customerId, Name, Email, ShippingAddress, Cart (Shopping Cart object)
    - Methods : checkout(), viewOrderHistory()
    
- Order :
    - Attributes : OrderId, date, status(Available or not), finalTotal, PurchaseItemsNumber
    - Methods : printRecipt(), updateStatus()
    
 

